'''Chickzilla''' is a [[Mob]] spawned by {{NPCSprite|Igrupan}} after reaching {{Reputation|mage|7,000}}.

== Spawning ==
If the player is in the Mage [[Faction]], has completed {{NPCSprite|Igrupan}}'s Quest, and has at least {{Reputation|Mage|7,000}}, Igrupan will call the player, and ask them to come to {{Zone|Igrupan's Chicken Coop}}. If the player then interacts with Igrupan, they will spawn '''Chickzilla'''. 

If the player gets killed by '''Chickzilla''', it will despawn. The player has to start over by talking to Igrupan again.

The '''Chickzilla''' fight can only be completed once per [[profile]].

== Behavior ==
'''Chickzilla''' can only be damaged by melee attacks.

