== Tips ==
* Since '''Chickzilla''' is an {{mt|Animal}} mob, {{Item|Mastiff Armor}} and a {{Item|Pooch Sword}} is good for increased damage and damage reduction against it.
* It is recommended to have a {{Item|Summoning Ring}} when fighting '''Chickzilla''', as there will be a {{Green|1%}} chance of obtaining a [[Necromancy|Soul]] worth upwards of billions.

